","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-05-27T12:14:26Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T13:27:15Z","closed_at":"2025-05-27T13:17:10Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.5.dev [6c9765d87e142e786f0190783f41a0250a835c99]\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev (c30470aad) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7628) - AMD Ryzen 9 9900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nBuilding the web template is incredibly slow due to the extremely long linking process, which makes repeated cycles of fixing and rebuilding very frustrating.\n\nI was able to reduce the build time from around 3 minutes to a few seconds by adding build options, as suggested in the comments below. I'd like to propose adding a \"fast build\" mode to SCons to facilitate this.\n\nhttps://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/issues/17019#issuecomment-1135253502\n\n```diff\ndiff --git a/platform/web/SCsub b/platform/web/SCsub\n--- a/platform/web/SCsub\t(revision 6c9765d87e142e786f0190783f41a0250a835c99)\n+++ b/platform/web/SCsub\t(date 1748347462087)\n@@ -104,6 +104,10 @@\n     sys_env.Append(LIBS=[\"idbfs.js\"])\n     build = sys_env.add_program(build_targets, web_files + [\"web_runtime.cpp\"])\n \n+sys_env.Append(LINKFLAGS=[\"-s\", \"ERROR_ON_WASM_CHANGES_AFTER_LINK\"])\n+sys_env.Append(LINKFLAGS=[\"-s\", \"WASM_BIGINT\"])\n+sys_env.Append(LINKFLAGS=[\"-O1\"])\n+\n sys_env.Depends(build[0], sys_env[\"JS_LIBS\"])\n sys_env.Depends(build[0], sys_env[\"JS_PRE\"])\n sys_env.Depends(build[0], sys_env[\"JS_POST\"])\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```\nscons platform=web target=template_debug\n```\n\nor\n\n```\nscons platform=web target=template_release\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis is a Godot build script issue, so no MRP can be provided.","closed_by":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106865/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106865/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}